 job of printing out pictures and placing them into a container, you must perform your duties whilst being paranoid about the nightmarish creatures that await you outside your office. The lights occasionally turn off, and you must venture out of your comfort zone to restore it via a lever right outside.\n\nOutside of your office (and sometimes in), there are nightmarish shadow people that will attempt to kill you. Equip your instant camera and use it to survive, you have no choice.\n\nYou need to plan your way to the lever to end the nightmare temporarily.\n\nOr end it entirely...", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/polarize"}